recommend keep-going -- two doors, both cheap. The card stands under its bound with little room, so the next lap folds a finished section before it writes. %440's writer is the better door: six firings today, three inside one send, each repaired by the same dedupe-and-sort by hand. And %464's own repair is one line of a label and one sentence of a header in pheromone's lane, priced not taken; a peer picking it up costs minutes. construction/archive is also 3 past the 256 bound, advisory today and growing every lap on every ship. The standing question about claiming an OPEN row at start now has a fourth instance: two ships built a census of the same thing in one night, and neither could see the other working.
